cff-version: 1.2.0
title: ghostswap-agents — multi-LLM agent integration pack for the GhostSwap Partners API
message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
authors:
  - name: GhostSwap
    website: 'https://ghostswap.io'
repository-code: 'https://github.com/ghostswap1/ghostswap-agents'
url: 'https://ghostswap.io'
abstract: >-
  An open-source distribution pack that lets developers integrate the
  GhostSwap Partners API into Claude, ChatGPT, Cursor, Windsurf,
  Gemini, GitHub Copilot, Continue.dev, OpenAI Agents SDK, LangChain,
  LlamaIndex, and any Model Context Protocol (MCP) client. Bundles
  an MCP server, an Anthropic Agent Skill, an OpenAPI 3.1
  specification, AGENTS.md cross-tool instructions, Cursor project
  rules, GitHub Copilot custom instructions, Windsurf Cascade rules,
  and a ChatGPT GPT Action setup guide.
